Package: readfiscalnz
Title: Reproducible New Zealand Treasury Fiscal Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Chartwell", "Macro", email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves, snapshots, validates, normalises, and links official
    New Zealand Treasury fiscal workbooks. Historical fiscal indicators, tax
    outturns, monthly statements, and economic and fiscal updates retain their
    accounting regime, forecast vintage, release, and byte-level provenance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readfiscalnz
BugReports: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readfiscalnz/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    digest,
    readxl,
    xml2
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    ps,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
